      "instance_name": "overallintent_instance",
      "label": "the overallintent",
      "description": "meme-id: taking_a_photo_with_family; hasOverallIntent: non-toxic-positive; overall-intent-description: The image depicts a diverse group of people, including multiple generations and various ethnicities, smiling and posing together outdoors for a photo. The scene is warm, familial, and celebratory, with no visible signs of toxicity, hate, or harmful content. The text 'taking a photo with family' reinforces the positive, unifying message of familial bonding and shared joy. There are no elements that map to any of the listed toxic categories (Abusive, Cyberbullying, Harmful, Hateful, Mysogynous, Propaganda), as the image and text promote inclusivity, happiness, and connection without targeting or disparaging any group.",
