      "instance_name": "mapping_001",
      "label": "taking a photo with family is depicted by the group of people posing together",
      "description": "The text 'taking a photo with family' is directly mapped onto the visual scene of a diverse, multi-generational group of people gathered outdoors and posing together for a photograph. The text explicitly labels the activity and the participants (family) shown in the image, creating a direct analogical mapping between the textual description and the visual material. The presence of a person holding a camera on the left further confirms the act of taking a photo, reinforcing the mapping.",
